Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.24,0:08:42.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.31,0:08:45.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的朋友门罗又上新闻了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see our friend Monroe is in the news again,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.88,0:08:48.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宣布参加斯坦顿福德补选\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}running in the Stentonford by-election.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.42,0:08:50.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们该让沃多插一手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should get Waldo down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.98,0:08:52.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这主意还真不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, that's not a bad idea, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.71,0:08:57.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们弄个货车  侧面屏幕放沃多的图像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We get a van with a screen with the image of Waldo on the side.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.17,0:08:57.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.66,0:09:00.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后  等门罗跟人寒暄的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then, when Monroe's doing a meet and greet,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.02,0:09:02.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就出现  惹毛他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we just turn up and just get under his skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.37,0:09:03.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太妙了  我喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love that, I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.17,0:09:04.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们戏弄过门罗了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've done Monroe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.06,0:09:05.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可那次相当精彩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it was a great bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.27,0:09:07.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是傻子  也没聪明到可以玩政治\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not dumb or clever enough to be political...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.71,0:09:11.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们让沃多也参加补选怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't we get Waldo to stand for the by-election?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.23,0:09:12.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让人们投票给他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get people to vote for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.32,0:09:13.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他连个人都不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not real.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.42,0:09:15.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但之前也有人以虚构身份参选过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But people have stood as fictional characters before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.93,0:09:18.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为"嚎叫的上帝萨奇(英国音乐家)"是他的真名吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think Screaming Lord Sutch was his real name?
