Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.61,0:09:20.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在选票上注明"俗称沃多"就行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just put "Commonly known as" on the ballot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.73,0:09:22.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人会真的投票给他  投票不是重点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No-one's actually going to vote for him, that's not the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.91,0:09:25.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重点是  我们可以凑热闹  可以参与计票\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The point is, we get to hang around, we're there for the count.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.22,0:09:28.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莎拉  快写上去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, go on then, Sara, whack it up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.29,0:09:47.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在和几对母子讲话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's with a mum and baby group.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.82,0:09:52.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备直播  五  四  三  二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK. Going live in five, four, three, two...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.52,0:09:53.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常感谢大家今天上午能来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you so much for joining me this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.75,0:09:55.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我学到不少东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been incredibly informative
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.69,0:09:56.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得我们应该\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I think we should
