Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.60,0:10:04.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢大家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.58,0:10:11.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家好  我是沃多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, it's me Waldo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.93,0:10:14.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伙计  我喜欢你的运动鞋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. I like your trainers, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.38,0:10:15.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我自己也想穿运动鞋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd wear trainers myself
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.49,0:10:17.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可我穿不了  因为没有脚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I can't cos I haven't got feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.21,0:10:18.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有一对桩子腿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got stumps.
