Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.15,0:10:22.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,门罗先生  门罗先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Mr Monroe! Mr Monroe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.74,0:10:25.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你结识哪个妈妈了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Did you get off with any of the mums?
