Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.38,0:10:42.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去查一下车里那些白痴的资料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's find out what we can about the idiot inside that thing.
