Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.02,0:11:18.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是斯坦顿福德和赫舍姆选区竞选的首日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Day one of the campaign in Stentonford and Hersham,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.82,0:11:21.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保守党希望连姆·门罗能迎来开门红\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Tory hopeful Liam Monroe hits the ground running.
