Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.68,0:11:31.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看过来啊  门罗先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look over here, Mr. Monroe...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.18,0:11:33.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保守党一直...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Conservative Party have been, er...
