Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.00,0:11:42.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  这里有点吵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. It's rather loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.47,0:11:45.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一直支持进一步降低执照费用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have argued for a further reduction in the licence fee...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.69,0:11:47.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.23,0:11:48.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个推婴儿车的妈妈  把她拉进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mum with a pushchair, drag her into it.
