Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.05,0:11:59.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,门罗先生  沃多怎么惹到你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Monroe, what's Waldo done to you?
