Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.85,0:33:45.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还能去除人的任何不良因素\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}minus the potential downsides of a human messenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.82,0:33:49.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在辩论中  你的团队可以搜索对方的每句话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In a debate, your team could Google every word the other guy says,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.69,0:33:51.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让沃多反驳他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then let Waldo hit him with debunk stats
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.68,0:33:54.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还能跟上一句能在推特上疯传的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and spit a Twitter-ready zinger into the next sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.14,0:33:57.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是最佳的打手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's the perfect assassin.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.59,0:33:59.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们赢不了的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We won't win, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.50,0:34:04.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们太英国了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys are so British.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.68,0:34:06.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他当然赢不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, of course he won't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.94,0:34:08.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们从一开始就是些粗俗段子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You started out too coarse off the bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.88,0:34:10.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们提出的东西都是虚幻的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no substantial basis to what you offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.82,0:34:14.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那套虚无主义的"民主完蛋"论调\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the whole nihilist "Democracy sucks" thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.46,0:34:16.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是挺有话题性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}yeah, is kind of wack-a-doo,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.17,0:34:18.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但如果有一条有意义的信息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but with a targeted, hopeful message,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.90,0:34:20.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个我们可以提供\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which we can provide,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.86,0:34:24.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既能激起底层人的热情又不吓坏中产阶级\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}energising the disenfranchised without spooking the middle
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.17,0:34:26.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,借助你们的新平台\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}via your new platform...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.45,0:34:28.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是全球性的政治娱乐产品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got a global political-entertainment product
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.96,0:34:31.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且人们会想购买\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}people actually want.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.43,0:34:34.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们可以向全球发展\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could roll this out worldwide.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.71,0:34:36.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像品客薯片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like Pringles.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.61,0:34:38.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.87,0:34:45.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,的确挺有趣的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's, er... It's interesting stuff though.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.30,0:34:47.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等你们折腾够了斯坦顿福德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you're done with Stentonford,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.81,0:34:50.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许南美还有机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there may be an opportunity in South America.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.41,0:34:52.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会说西班牙语吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Se puede hablar espanol?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.27,0:34:54.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在马德里生活了三年呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vivi en Madrid tres anos.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.02,0:34:56.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excelente.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.70,0:35:17.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.15,0:35:19.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.00,0:35:21.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他可是政党领袖啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he's the party leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.28,0:35:23.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,影响太差了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's too toxic.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.83,0:35:30.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与此同时  格温多林·哈里斯的支持率在减小\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meanwhile, as support for Gwendolyn Harris appears to be dwindling,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.59,0:35:34.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而工党否认党派对这位年轻的候选人失去了信心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Labour denies the party is losing faith in their young candidate.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.08,0:35:37.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而哈里斯小姐几乎整日在党总部忙于\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Miss Harris spent most of the day locked in crisis talks
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.55,0:35:39.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应对危机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at party headqu...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.31,0:35:44.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在斯坦顿福德补选中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the Stentonford by-election,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.38,0:35:47.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡通熊沃多继续...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Waldo the cartoon bear continues...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.66,0:35:50.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你昨天看到格温多林·哈里斯了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you see Gwendolyn Harris yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.08,0:35:52.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像是中毒了似的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She looks like she's been poisoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.14,0:35:54.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为他会超过她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because he's gonna overtake her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.50,0:35:55.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还是遥遥领先\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're still way ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.79,0:35:57.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果那东西成了主要对手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If that thing is the main opposition
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.68,0:35:59.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是给整个系统丢脸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then the whole system looks absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.03,0:36:03.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,极可能就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which it may well be.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.53,0:36:06.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但系统还是建了这些路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it built these roads.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.03,0:36:15.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进来吧  罗伊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just come in, Roy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.38,0:36:24.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.36,0:36:27.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不该那么跟你说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was wrong to speak to you like that and...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.00,0:36:30.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竞选结束后  我会给你打电话的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After the campaign, I would've called you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.35,0:36:32.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竞选结束后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After the campaign!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.54,0:36:35.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这样只是让门罗更占优势了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All you've done is strengthen Monroe.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.40,0:36:37.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你反正也不会赢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't win either,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.28,0:36:39.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我至少还想代表...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I was at least attempting to represent...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.37,0:36:43.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道是什么  但绝不是"都是瞎扯"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well I don't know! Not just "Bollocks to everything".
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.57,0:36:45.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你真想推行革命也算是厉害了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you were preaching revolution, well that'd be something,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.95,0:36:49.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你不是  因为那需要勇气和智慧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you're not because that would require courage and a mindset.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.46,0:36:51.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what have you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.83,0:36:55.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.26,0:36:57.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有什么立场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you for?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.71,0:37:06.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.84,0:37:17.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后一击了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, final push.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.77,0:37:19.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟大家说有个软件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You remind everyone that's got the app
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.17,0:37:20.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果他们向朋友推荐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that if they recommend it to a friend
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.36,0:37:23.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沃多就能得到顶帽子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it unlocks a little fez for Waldo.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.51,0:37:24.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.14,0:37:29.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位请注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attention, shoppers.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.30,0:37:32.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有要事相求  请过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm here to ask you an important favour. Gather round.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.94,0:37:35.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过来  听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come over here and listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.49,0:37:40.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别为我投票  我就是个侮辱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't vote for me. I'm an insult.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.00,0:37:41.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.92,0:37:44.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,投票给门罗或者哈里斯  或者独立党\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vote for Monroe or Harris or, I dunno, UKIP,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.99,0:37:47.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪怕是那个自由民主党的家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or even that Lib Dem guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.41,0:37:48.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是个二货\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a prick!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.54,0:37:52.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的  只有傻逼才会投票给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seriously, only an arsehole would actually vote for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.14,0:37:53.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这是反讽吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this? Irony?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.24,0:37:55.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你浪费一票都比投给我强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm worse than a wasted vote.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.18,0:37:56.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那人是哈里斯阵营的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's from the Harris campaign.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.93,0:37:59.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说真的  白痴  别投给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean it, you idiots! Don't vote for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.24,0:38:01.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别投给我  别投给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't vote for me! Don't vote for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.28,0:38:02.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别投给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't vote for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.28,0:38:05.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别投给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't vmmmf!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.55,0:38:08.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.64,0:38:10.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  别嘘他  他是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Don't boo him, he's right! He's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.65,0:38:11.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这是干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.52,0:38:12.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辞职\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Resigning.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.26,0:38:13.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,詹米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jamie!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.19,0:38:17.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧啊  是我  我是沃多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look! It's me, I'm Waldo.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.13,0:38:19.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个人  不论他是谁  他是个英雄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This guy, whoever this guy is, he's a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.75,0:38:21.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们该冲沃多扔东西  他不是好东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should throw stuff at Waldo, he's bad bloody news.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.96,0:38:22.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他好玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.80,0:38:23.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不好玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.38,0:38:26.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别听他的  他是个女同性恋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't listen to that man, he's a lesbian. Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.59,0:38:28.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别忘了  投票开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So remember, the polls are open,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.20,0:38:29.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你们有我的软件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and if you've got my app,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.63,0:38:33.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以解锁一些流行语或者小帽子什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you can unlock new stuff like catchphrases and a little hat 'n' that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.54,0:38:35.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有白痴才不会给我投票\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only an idiot wouldn't vote for me
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.68,0:38:37.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,质疑现状\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so question the status quo!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.44,0:38:38.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀掉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill it! Kill it!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.65,0:38:39.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直击要害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kick them where it hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.40,0:38:43.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一个打他的人有五百镑可拿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The first man to hit him gets 500 quid!
